/** @page overview Overview

- [Bivariate copula models](overview-bicop.html)
- [Vine copula models](overview-vinecop.html)
- [Discrete variables](discrete.html)
- [Conditional simulation](conditional.html)
- [Scores, gradients and Hessians](inference.html)

All examples assume `using namespace vinecopulib;`. Each one is an excerpt of a
complete program under `docs/snippets/`, compiled and run as part of the
documentation build.

While the namespace `vinecopulib` contains the most important functionality,
two others are meant for direct use:
- `bicop_families`: convenience definitions of sets of bivariate copula families,
- `tools_stats`: utilities for statistical analysis, including `to_pseudo_obs()`
  and the quasi-random generators behind `simulate_uniform()`.

